---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | Alec Ray Sherman"
  description="How alecraysherman.com uses the Meta Pixel."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <h1
      class="text-5xl font-normal tracking-wide"
      style="font-family: 'Questrial', system-ui, sans-serif;"
    >
      Privacy
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      <p>
        This site belongs to Alec Ray Sherman. It doesn't have accounts, sell
        anything, or ask you for personal information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 text-2xl font-normal text-neutral-900">Meta Pixel</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses the Meta Pixel, a tool from Meta Platforms (the company
        behind Facebook and Instagram). When you visit, the pixel uses cookies
        and similar technology to tell Meta which pages you viewed and whether
        you clicked a streaming link, along with standard information your
        browser sends, such as your IP address and device type. I use this to
        measure whether my Facebook and Instagram ads are working and to show
        my music to people who might like it. Meta handles this information
        under its own
        <a
          class="underline underline-offset-4"
          href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer">privacy policy</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 text-2xl font-normal text-neutral-900">Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can control how Meta uses this information for ads in your
        <a
          class="underline underline-offset-4"
          href="https://accountscenter.facebook.com/ad_preferences"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer">Meta ad preferences</a
        >, opt out of interest-based ads through the
        <a
          class="underline underline-offset-4"
          href="https://youradchoices.ca/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer">Digital Advertising Alliance of Canada</a
        >, or block cookies in your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 text-2xl font-normal text-neutral-900">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this page:
        <a
          class="underline underline-offset-4"
          href="mailto:murdermysteryrecordings@gmail.com"
          >murdermysteryrecordings@gmail.com</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
